<title>UK: YTV says hasn't had Granada bid talks.</title>
<headline>YTV says hasn't had Granada bid talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Yorkshire-Tyne Tees Television Holdings Plc said on Friday it had not held talks with media firm Granada Group Plc about a Granada bid for the company.</p>
<p>Yorkshire's statement came after Granada said on Thursday it had no current intention of bidding for the firm, despite market speculation that it might make an offer.</p>
